        "id": "KindredPassiveManager",
        "name": "Mark of the Kindred",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Kindred can mark targets to Hunt. Successfully completing a Hunt permanently empowers Kindred's basic abilities. Every 4 hunts completed also increases Kindred's basic attack range.",
        "bodyHtml": "Kindred can designate a champion to hunt by clicking their portrait above their inventory. They also designate certain jungle monsters to hunt with an icon on the minimap automatically.<br /><br />Getting a takedown on a hunted target grants Kindred a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mark</span>, empowering them. After 4 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Marks</span>, Kindred gains ? Attack Range. Every 3 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Marks</span> after the fourth grants a further 25 Attack Range.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Marks</span> empower Kindred's basic Abilities:<span><span>?</span> grants an additional <span>5% Attack Speed</span><span><span>?</span> deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">1% current Health damage</span>.<span><span>?</span> deal an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">0.5% missing Health damage</span>.",
