        "bodyHtml": "Kindred vaults, firing an arrow at up to 3 enemies, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(40/65/90/115/140 + (75% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and gaining <span>40% Attack Speed</span> for 4 seconds.<br /><br />While inside of <span>Wolf's Frenzy</span>, this Ability's Cooldown is reduced to 4/3.5/3/2.5/2 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Attack Speed scales with <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Marks</span> taken.</span>",
