      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "KindredW",
        "name": "Wolf's Frenzy",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Wolf enrages and attacks enemies around him.  Lamb passively gains stacks by moving and attacking. When fully charged, Lamb's next attack restores health.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Kindred gains stacks as they move and attack. At 100 stacks, Kindred's next Attack restores up to <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">47 Health</span> based on their missing Health.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Kindred claims a territory, ordering Wolf to bite at the last enemy Lamb Attacked. Wolf's bites deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/30/35/40/45 + (20% bonus Attack Damage) + (20% Ability Power))</span> plus <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">2.5% current Health magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Wolf strikes faster based on Kindred's <span>Attack Speed</span>. Against jungle monsters, Wolf deals 50% increased damage and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> them by 50% for 2 seconds.</span>",
