        "name": "Mounting Dread",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Lamb fires a carefully placed shot, slowing the target. If Lamb attacks the target two more times, her third attack instead directs Wolf to pounce on the enemy, savaging them for massive damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Kindred weakens an enemy, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by (30 + (5% Ability Power))for 1 second.<br /><br />Kindred's third Attack against the target within 4 seconds of each other directs Wolf to pounce on the enemy, dealing an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(80/110/140/170/200 + (100% bonus Attack Damage))</span> plus <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">5.5% missing Health physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Damage is increased by Critical Strike Chance and Damage at 50% effectiveness.<br />Missing health damage is capped at 200 against jungle monsters.</span>",
